e":"text","value":"이상적인 토크나이저","position":{"start":{"line":2,"column":1},"end":{"line":2,"column":1}},"key":"aEFdZnPNW1"}],"key":"AY964NVniN"},{"type":"text","value":"라면 삽입 지점 이전의 토큰은 그대로, 이후의 토큰은 ","position":{"start":{"line":2,"column":1},"end":{"line":2,"column":1}},"key":"pbFuhszh7J"},{"type":"strong","position":{"start":{"line":2,"column":1},"end":{"line":2,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"같은 문자열이 좌표만 1칸 밀려","position":{"start":{"line":2,"column":1},"end":{"line":2,"column":1}},"key":"GgSe1EDR8k"}],"key":"zIEEgTFnJO"},{"type":"text","value":" 나와야 한다.\n실제로 그런지 보기 위해 각 토큰을 ","position":{"start":{"line":2,"column":1},"end":{"line":2,"column":1}},"key":"bQX4TSHZbu"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"(시작, 끝, 문자열)","position":{"start":{"line":2,"column":1},"end":{"line":2,"column":1}},"key":"ML7KLr8mJB"},{"type":"text","value":"로 기록하고, 삽입 후 좌표를 되돌려 ","position":{"start":{"line":2,"column":1},"end":{"line":2,"column":1}},"key":"SQWLKqeYuB"},{"type":"strong","position":{"start":{"line":2,"column":1},"end":{"line":2,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"원래 토큰이 그대로 보존된 비율","position":{"start":{"line":2,"column":1},"end":{"line":2,"column":1}},"key":"OyJ6DwiMrY"}],"key":"xGhKddKLxe"},{"type":"text","value":"을 잰다. 좌표를 되돌리는 것은 비교용 규칙일 뿐이며 토큰화 결과가 보존된다는 뜻이 아니다.","position":{"start":{"line":2,"column":1},"end":{"line":2,"column":1}},"key":"Tto1hmqgIM"}],"key":"eR24NYnwkI"}],"identifier":"cell-012","html_id":"cell-012","key":"MgdvS7mZnC"},{"type":"block","kind":"notebook-code","data":{"execution":{"iopub.execute_input":"2026-11-10T19:40:20.189357Z","iopub.status.busy":"2026-11-10T19:40:20.189207Z","iopub.status.idle":"2026-11-10T19:40:20.308408Z","shell.execute_reply":"2026-11-10T19:40:20.307959Z"}},"children":[{"type":"code","lang":"python","executable":true,"value":"INS_POS = 500\n\n\ndef spans_single(seq):\n    return [(i, i + 1, c) for i, c in enumerate(seq)]\n\n\ndef spans_kmer(seq, k=K, stride=1):\n    return [(i, i + k, seq[i:i + k]) for i in range(0, len(seq) - k + 1, stride)]\n\n\ndef spans_bpe(seq, tk=bpe512):\n    enc = tk.encode(seq)\n    return [(a, b, t) for (a, b), t in zip(enc.offsets, enc.tokens)]\n\n\ndef conserved_fraction(span_fn, n=100):\n    fracs = []\n    for s in corpus[:n]:\n        s2 = s[:INS_POS] + \"A\" + s[INS_POS:]  # 위치 500에 'A' 삽입\n        base = set(span_fn(s))\n        mapped = set()\n        for a, b, t in span_fn(s2):\n            if b <= INS_POS:              # 삽입 지점 이전: 좌표 그대로\n                mapped.add((a, b, t))\n            elif a >= INS_POS + 1:        # 삽입 지점 이후: 좌표를 1칸 되돌림\n                mapped.add((a - 1, b - 1, t))\n            # 삽입된 염기를 포함하는 토큰은 제외\n        fracs.append(len(base & mapped) / len(base))\n    return float(np.mean(fracs))\n\n\nresults = {\n    \"single nt\": conserved_fraction(spans_single),\n    \"k-mer overlap\": conserved_fraction(lambda s: spans_kmer(s, stride=1)),\n    \"k-mer non-overlap\": conserved_fraction(lambda s: spans_kmer(s, stride=K)),\n    \"BPE (512)\": conserved_fraction(spans_bpe),\n}\nfor name, v in results.items():\n    print(f\"{name:20s} 보존된 토큰 비율: {v:.3f}\")","key":"mE2BfJti0O"},{"type":"outputs","id":"71M9J4s071-ALyaXy9byM","children":[{"type":"output","jupyter_data":{"name":"stdout","output_type":"stream","text":"single nt            보존된 토큰 비율: 1.000\nk-mer overlap        보존된 토큰 비율: 0.995\nk-mer non-overlap    보존된 토큰 비율: 0.500\nBPE (512)            보존된 토큰 비율: 0.993\n"},"children":[],"key":"esrSrZMqiU"}],"key":"CpKbj0MOfG"}],"identifier":"cell-013","html_id":"cell-013","key":"WmnEBe1oNH"},{"type":"block","kind":"notebook-content","children":[{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":3,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"strong","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"해석 (seed=0 기준)","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"key":"ByX7dyR2r8"}],"key":"IGiZTg09Nu"},{"type":"text","value":": 비겹침 k-mer는 삽입 지점 이후 전체가 새 프레임으로 바뀌므로, 삽입 위치가 중간인 이 설정에서 보존 비율이 대략 절반이다.\n단일 뉴클레오타이드(1.00), 겹침 k-mer(약 0.995), BPE(약 0.99)는 좌표를 되돌리면 거의 모두 보존된다. BPE는 병합 규칙이 국소적이어서 삽입 지점 주변의 토큰 몇 개만 달라진다.\nindel(삽입·결실) 효과를 다루는 변이 모델이라면 이 성질이 중요하다.","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"key":"z3QkI25n1d"}],"key":"EruBd9fYC3"}],"identifier":"cell-014","html_id":"cell-014","key":"LHCXWSLK5G"},{"type":"block","kind":"notebook-content","children":[{"type":"heading","depth":2,"position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"6. 겹침 k-mer의 마스킹 누출","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"key":"yVVvByO82y"}],"identifier":"id-6-k-mer","label":"6. 겹침 k-mer의 마스킹 누출","html_id":"id-6-k-mer","implicit":true,"key":"yVB36VlqPq"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":2,"column":1},"end":{"line":3,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"겹침 k-mer에서 토큰 하나를 마스킹해도, 그 토큰의 염기는 ","position":{"start":{"line":2,"column":1},"end":{"line":2,"column":1}},"key":"X02qjSmN3x"},{"type":"strong","position":{"start":{"line":2,"column":1},"end":{"line":2,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"이웃 토큰들","position":{"start":{"line":2,"column":1},"end":{"line":2,"column":1}},"key":"hqUteiwJ71"}],"key":"FnkBoJaEeh"},{"type":"text","value":"에 그대로 들어 있다.\n마스킹하는 연속 토큰 수를 늘려 가며, 마스킹한 토큰의 염기 중 ","position":{"start":{"line":2,"column":1},"end":{"line":2,"column":1}},"key":"bcWM41vlZU"},{"type":"strong","position":{"start":{"line":2,"column":1},"end":{"line":2,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"가려지지 않은 비율","position":{"start":{"line":2,"column":1},"end":{"line":2,"column":1}},"key":"BuX2EVdgqB"}],"key":"gJLELBhnCL"},{"type":"text","value":"을 계산한다.","position":{"start":{"line":2,"column":1},"end":{"line":2,"column":1}},"key":"NKJgbEjrO4"}],"key":"leBrD2MEXJ"}],"identifier":"cell-015","html_id":"cell-015","key":"QKOSsjUiD9"},{"type":"block","kind":"notebook-code","data":{"execution":{"iopub.execute_input":"2026-11-10T19:40:20.309769Z","iopub.status.busy":"2026-11-10T19:40:20.309683Z","iopub.status.idle":"2026-11-10T19:40:20.313069Z","shell.execute_reply":"2026-11-10T19:40:20.312620Z"}},"children":[{"type":"code","lang":"python","executable":true,"value":"def leaked_fraction(width, k=K, target=100, length=300):\n    \"\"\"target 토큰 주변 ±width개 토큰을 함께 마스킹했을 때, target의 염기 중 이웃(보이는) 토큰에 남은 비율.\"\"\"\n    spans = [(i, i + k) for i in range(length - k + 1)]\n    t0, t1 = spans[target]\n    covered = np.zeros(length, dtype=bool)\n    for j, (a, b) in enumerate(spans):\n        if abs(j - target) > width:       # 마스킹되지 않은 토큰만 '보임'\n            covered[a:b] = True\n    return float(covered[t0:t1].mean())\n\n\nfor w in range(0, 7):\n    print(f\"±{w} 토큰 마스킹 (총 {2 * w + 1}개) → 누출 비율 {leaked_fraction(w):.2f}\")","key":"OlbLsEFmq5"},{"type":"outputs","id":"a7IKLrTJUMvA_iJslOoLw","children":[{"type":"output","jupyter_data":{"name":"stdout","output_type":"stream","text":"±0 토큰 마스킹 (총 1개) → 누출 비율 1.00\n±1 토큰 마스킹 (총 3개) → 누출 비율 1.00\n±2 토큰 마스킹 (총 5개) → 누출 비율 1.00\n±3 토큰 마스킹 (총 7개) → 누출 비율 0.67\n±4 토큰 마스킹 (총 9개) → 누출 비율 0.33\n±5 토큰 마스킹 (총 11개) → 누출 비율 0.00\n±6 토큰 마스킹 (총 13개) → 누출 비율 0.00\n"},"children":[],"key":"M4Yto73XUu"}],"key":"PTzkRNJcEk"}],"identifier":"cell-016","html_id":"cell-016","key":"acVWnlUKe3"},{"type":"block","kind":"notebook-content","children":[{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":3,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"strong","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"결론","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"key":"BERCf1Rzow"}],"key":"kzxXjaA6fg"},{"type":"text","value":": 한 토큰만 마스킹하면 누출이 100%다. 토큰의 염기를 모두 가리려면 ","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"key":"zfSlsCaPmX"},{"type":"strong","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"te